#: minicli.cpp:820
msgid ""
"Running a realtime application can be very dangerous. If the application "
"misbehaves, the system might hang unrecoverably.\n"
"Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Wenn een Echttied-Applikatschoon löppt kann dat gefährlich ween. Dat kann "
"woll ween, dat de Applikatschoon wat falsch doet un de heel Systeem hangen "
"blifft.\n"
"Wullt Du redig wiedermaken?"

#: minicli.cpp:823
msgid "Warning - Run Command"
msgstr "Wohrschoen - Befehl utföhrn"

#: minicli.cpp:823
msgid "&Run Realtime"
msgstr "As &Echttied-Applikatschoon utföhren"

#: rc.cpp:4
#, fuzzy
msgid "Run with realtime &scheduling"
msgstr "In Echttied &Bedriev löpen laten"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid ""
"<qt>Select whether realtime scheduling should be enabled for the "
"application. The scheduler governs which process will run and which will "
"have to wait. Two schedulers are available:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><em>Normal:</em> This is the standard, timesharing scheduler. It will "
"divide fairly the available processing time between all processes.</li>\n"
"<li><em>Realtime:</em>"
"This scheduler will run your application uninterrupted until it gives up the "
"processor. This can be dangerous. An application that does not give up the "
"processor might hang the system. You need root's password to use the "
"scheduler.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Schall de Echttied-Bedriev brukt warrn oder nich? De Opgaav Verwalter "
"stüert of welken vun de Perzessen töven und welken wiedermaken kann. Dat "
"gifft twee Perzess Arten vun Vewalters:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><em>Normal:</em> Dat is de standard Opgaav Vewaalter. De deelt de "
"Perzesstied recht twüschen de Perzessen op.</li>\n"
"<li><em>Echittied:</em> Dat is de Opgaav Vewalter de de Applikatschoon nich "
"afbrickt. Een Applikatschoon de nich anhält kann utlösen dat dien "
"Systeemhangen blifft. Um düssen Vewalter to bruken, muttst Du dat "
"Root-Passwoort kennen.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "User&name:"
msgstr "&Bruukernaam:"

#: rc.cpp:7 rc.cpp:17
msgid "Enter the user you want to run the application as here."
msgstr "Giff de Naam vun'n Bruker in, för den de Applikatschoon lopen schall."

#: rc.cpp:8 rc.cpp:10
msgid "Enter the password here for the user you specified above."
msgstr "Giff hier dat Passwoort för den baben utsökten Bruker in."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "Pass&word:"
msgstr "Pass&woort:"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Run in &terminal window"
msgstr "In'n &Terminal Finster lopen laten"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"Check this option if the application you want to run is a text mode "
"application. The application will then be run in a terminal emulator window."
msgstr ""
"Markeer düsse Optschoon, wenn dat Programm, de Du starten wullt, een "
"Programm för Textbedriev is. Dat Programm löppt denn in en Terminal "
"Emulator Finster."

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "&Priority:"
msgstr "&Rang:"

#: rc.cpp:14 rc.cpp:19 rc.cpp:21 rc.cpp:22
msgid ""
"The priority that the command will be run with can be set here. From left to "
"right, it goes from low to high. The center position is the default value. "
"For priorities higher than the default, you will need to provide the root "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Den Rang vun'n Befehl kannst Du hier instellen. Links is siet un rechts is "
"hooch. De Standard Wert is in de midden. Wenn Du een Rang höger as de "
"Standard Rang instellen wullt, muttst Du dat Root-Passwoort ingeven."

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Run with a &different priority"
msgstr "Mit en &annern Rang lopen laten"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different "
"priority. A higher priority tells the operating system to give more "
"processing time to your application."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du dat Programm mit een annern Rang löpen laten wullt, muttst Du "
"düsse Optschoon markeern. Mit een högern Rang kriegt dat Programm mehr "
"Tied för't Reknen."

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Siet"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "High"
msgstr "Hooch"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "Run as a different &user"
msgstr "As een annern Br&uker lopen laten"

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to run the application with a different user "
"id. Every process has a user id associated with it. This id code determines "
"file access and other permissions. The password of the user is required to "
"do this."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du dit Programm mit een annern Bruker löpen laten wullt muttst Du "
"düsse Optschoon markeern. För jedeen Perzess gifft dat een Bruker-Nummer. "
"Düsse Bruker-Nummer seggt keen Togriep hett un ok annere Verlöven. Dorför "
"brukst Du dat Passwoort vun den Bruker."

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid "Com&mand:"
msgstr "&Befehl:"

#: rc.cpp:26 rc.cpp:28
msgid ""
"Enter the command you wish to execute or the address of the resource you "
"want to open. This can be a remote URL like \"www.kde.org\" or a local one "
"like \"~/.kderc\"."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst een Befehl oder eene Adress ingeven, de Du opmaken wullt. Dat "
"kann een URL vun wiet weg as \"www.kde.org\" oder ok en lokaalen URL as "
"\"~/.kderc\".wesen."

#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Enter the name of the application you want to run or the URL you want to view"
msgstr ""
"Hier kannst Du den Naam vun'n Programm ingeven, dat Du bruken oder ok een "
"URL de Du ankieken wullt."

